# meta-marbles-22-completion-part-2.prompt

> **Self-contained part 2.** This artifact closes the residual debt that
> part 1 (`meta-marbles-22-completion.prompt`) did not converge on,
> plus the new debt surfaced by the 2026-05-14 vc-followup audit. You do
> NOT need to read part 1 or any original plan file — every task below
> embeds: current broken state, target state, file:line refs, test
> contract, negative check, round-trip e2e shape. If you find yourself
> wanting to "go read Plan NN" or "go read part 1" — STOP. Re-read this
> prompt; the answer is here. If it's not, the prompt has a gap and you
> should fix the prompt before the task.
>
> 𝚅𝚒𝚋𝚎𝚌𝚛𝚊𝚏𝚝𝚎𝚍. with AI Agents by Vetcoders (c)2024-2026 LibraxisAI

---

## 1. Operator brief — read once

### What this is

The Loctree LSP roadmap (22 plans, ~6 weeks of work) closed with a master
audit on 2026-05-10. Meta-marbles part 1 ran between 2026-05-10 and
2026-05-11 and converged all 2 P1 + 5/6 P2 wire breaks. Release v0.10.2
shipped (loctree 0.10.2 + aicx 0.7.3) carrying the LSP binary.

Then a vc-followup audit on 2026-05-14 (branch `fix/the-truth-of-findings`,
commit `b17fbdef`) surfaced **a different class of debt** that part 1 did
not target:

1. **Brand-coherence regresja** — 30 file headers in `loctree-lsp/src/`
   carry `(c) 2025-2026 Vetcoders` instead of canonical
   `(c)2024-2026 LibraxisAI`. Plan 21 polished serverInfo + schemas, not
   file headers. Released v0.10.2 carries non-canonical brand signatures.
2. **Tracker audit-trail lies** — TRACKER §1 promises 22 reports at
   `reports/lsp/<id>-<name>.md`; only 2 exist there. The rest are
   scattered across `.vibecrafted/artifacts/.../2026_05XX/reports/lsp/`
   and `.vibecrafted/reports/lsp/`. Three conventions, one false promise.
3. **Plan files 21/23/24 missing on disk** — Plan 21 backfilled as
   report-only; Plans 23/24 exist only as operational distillation in
   part 1 §8 Tier 5. Next agent listing `docs/plans/lsp/` will not find
   them.
4. **Cold-scan vs live-scan symbol_id asymmetry confirmed pervasive** —
   live path (Plan 18 v2 `extract_live_symbols`) populates `symbol_id`;
   cold-scan emits `SymbolIdV1::default()` at 20+ sites
   (`loctree-rs/src/analyzer/{trace,twins,dead_parrots,dist}.rs`). Symbol
   identity is not stable until first live edit. AICX correlation breaks
   at session start.

This prompt is the *single source of truth* for closing those gaps to
frontier SoTA grade before the SaaS-transformation wave (Plans 23+24
operational distillation in part 1 §8) can start safely.

### Why a part 2 instead of editing part 1

Two reasons:

1. **Part 1 is closed history.** Its P1/P2 tasks landed and were merged.
   Re-opening that artifact would smear the closure signal. Part 2 is
   the next discrete iteration on the same convergence axis.
2. **The new debt is meta-structural** — branding, audit-trail integrity,
   stage-2 deferrals, plan-file backfill. Different shape from part 1's
   wire-break debt. Cleaner as a separate scoreboard.

### What success looks like

When this prompt is fully checked-off:

- All P1 + P2 tasks marked `[x]` with commit SHA + test name + 1-2
  sentence comment.
- M-01 brand-coherence workspace-wide (loctree-lsp + loctree-rs +
  loctree-mcp + loctree-ast — operator decides scope; default is full
  workspace).
- A fresh reconciliation audit (analog of the 2026-05-10 one) returns
  `PASS` not `PASS_WITH_GAPS`.
- `/vc-polarize` is dispatched with the prism framings in §7. Polarize
  emits a DoU / release handoff identifying which of Loctree's competing
  truths the team commits to as primary.
- The next prompt (`meta-marbles-saas-handoff.prompt`) opens with the
  polarize verdict baked in, and Plans 23-24's deliverables become the
  wave 1 input (or get deprioritized to v0.12).

### What this is NOT

- It is not a backlog. Tasks are scoped to the followup audit + residual
  part-1 items; unbounded "things we could do" go to a separate
  brainstorm.
- It is not optional. M-01 (branding) is P1 — released binary carries
  non-canonical signature glyph. M-05 (cold-scan symbol_id) is P2 —
  symbol identity asymmetry zatruwa AICX correlation.
- It is not opinion. Every task cites file:line evidence. If you
  disagree, **reproduce the negative check first**, then update this
  prompt.

