## 3. Followup audit verdict (frozen) — read once

A vc-followup audit on 2026-05-14 against branch `fix/the-truth-of-findings`
@ `b17fbdef` returned:

### Master verdict

**ON_TRACK_WITH_DEBT.** Part 1 wire-break debt cleared. Part-2 debt is
meta-structural (brand, audit-trail, stage-2 deferrals, symbol-id
asymmetry). Acceptable for dogfooding; not acceptable as released-product
representation of LibraxisAI brand.

### Tally

| Bucket | Count | Items |
|---|---:|---|
| P1 | **1** | M-01 (brand-coherence regression in 30 LSP file headers) |
| P2 | 3 | M-02 (tracker report-path lies), M-05 (cold-scan symbol_id asymmetry, 20+ sites), T-07-combo verify |
| P3 | 4 | M-03 (plan-files 21/23/24 missing), M-04 (MISSING_*.md stale), T-14 (frontmatter count), T-08 (live aicx smoke), T-13 (has_snapshot fixture) |
| Tier 4 | 2 evidence + 2 stage-2 | T-19-R19.5, T-16-R05, Plan 19 stage 2 langs, Plan 16 stage 2 grammars |
| Tier 5 | 2 (gated) | T-23, T-24 — gated by `/vc-polarize` decision |

### The cross-task patterns that survived part 1

1. **Branding regression vector** — Plan 21 polished one surface (serverInfo);
   30 other surfaces (file headers) drifted. Lesson: brand-coherence is a
   workspace gate, not a per-feature gate.
2. **Audit-trail convention drift** — three report conventions in one repo
   (`reports/lsp/`, `.vibecrafted/reports/lsp/`, `.vibecrafted/artifacts/...
   /reports/lsp/`). Each agent picked their own path; tracker promises one.
   Lesson: report path discipline must be enforced in pre-commit hook or in
   the tracker update protocol.
3. **Stage-2 staleness** — Plan 16/19 marked `review`/`done` in tracker but
   real stage-2 is structurally absent (cold-scan symbol_id, 6+ language
   extractors). Lesson: STAGE_PASS verdict needs explicit ladder in tracker
   so "done" doesn't conflate with "stage 1 done."
4. **Plan-file as canonical anchor** — Plans 21/23/24 missing from
   `docs/plans/lsp/` means `loct find plan-21` or `grep -l "Plan 23"
   docs/plans/lsp/` yields nothing. Even when meta-marbles is operational
   source-of-truth, plan files act as the discoverable index. Backfill
   discipline matters.

