## 9. Exit contract — when all P1 + P2 are `[x]`

1. **Re-run reconciliation audit.** Confirm:
   - Branch tip carries no non-canonical brand signature (M-01).
   - `bash scripts/tracker_audit.sh` returns 0 (M-02).
   - `cold_scan_export_symbols_carry_typed_symbol_id` test green (M-05).
   - T-07-combo verification complete.
2. **Dispatch `/vc-polarize` with §7 prism framings.** Read the smear
   score. If smear > 0.3, polarize emits primary axis + DoU handoff.
3. **Bump TRACKER `last_updated`** + add rows 23/24 if backfilling
   (M-03).
4. **Move part-2 prompt to archive when all Tier 1-3 closed.**
   `git mv docs/plans/lsp/meta-marbles-22-completion-part-2.prompt
   docs/plans/lsp/archive/2026_05XX/`.
5. **Open the next prompt.** Either
   `meta-marbles-saas-handoff.prompt` (if SaaS-axis chosen) or
   `meta-marbles-stage-2-tree-sitter.prompt` (if LSP-daemon-axis with
   Stage-2 priority).

