## 10. Handoff scenarios — when P1+P2 NOT all done

| Scenario | Decision |
|---|---|
| M-01 not done, M-02/M-05 done | Do NOT cut a public release. Branded surface is the highest-visibility regression. |
| M-01 done, M-02/M-05 open | Acceptable to dogfood; not acceptable to invite external auditors. |
| All Tier 1-2 done, Tier 3 mixed | Operator decides: ship v0.11 (after polarize) with PASS_WITH_GAPS, or close Tier 3 first. |
| Tier 5 done but Tier 1-3 not | NOT possible — Tier 5 is gated. If someone pushes Tier 5 work, revert and re-prioritize. |
| Polarize emits competing-truth verdict | Operator + agents discuss; this prompt does not encode product strategy. |

